      "source_text": "然后总有一天要在“有马纪念”跟她对决……\n菱亚马逊怀抱着这个想法，\n往“樱花赏”迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "377a2c3485e3981c26be0ab84cbab55daccfcb7f184e05c48c60a64423deee0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
