    {
      "uid": "zhcn:737a878968a8a6952d366745",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊以“樱花赏”为目标全力向前。\n为了辅助她，\n训练员也构思了各种新的训练方案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "049b68918a6069ea4620520ac6a1e2f9939dcd5a0e667793bb59a6a6df22b05b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012402.json",
      "json_path": [
