    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42707759bf021e207b94558d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人齐心协力，一同加油……！\n最后，菱亚马逊有了大幅的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7dbfaefd2441b7708d3e25bf193bcdd8a5220708e9fd10f4e7de159c8ed5805",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012402.json",
      "json_path": [
