    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb97a167443a9a223bc98dc9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某一天，新闻报导了成田白仁负伤的消息。\n菱亚马逊前往探望，为了激发她的斗志而说\n“我在有马纪念等你”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd21c1fddf400bf827ece845024c12a4ac50d8cd88be06338c961eb910e8a588",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
