    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0331805970623f053783e73d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊回答了她。\n她说，因为你的背影不管离我多远，\n都会让我想要拼命追上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a18802c2b450c3514411bbd0e9a3eb2b77db40925a8f80f89741d68bfa0bfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012403.json",
      "json_path": [
