    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b10f50360ce809c0bc8caef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁顺利回归。\n然而，她失去了原有的魄力。\n看见那模样，菱亚马逊为之愕然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2b4dd3421b57c05ffae7b69e8ca3201d3601c2c9adf2655c4a4e2e4ee469e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
