    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76bac384a51609435cf25a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊想像成田白仁有多么不甘心，\n内心激动不已。\n在那之后，她走向了操场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "171b42f4ddbc640656ec950fd8d94f3aaf5dd4ae69ac161ab7a76fb87fded64c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
