    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d323b7fb72738199e44692",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "操场上，\n成田白仁正与鲁道夫象征进行并跑练习。\n即使被拉开相当大的差距，她仍拼死追赶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2011c66de6cefbb1ade4fa2d4b022407d7a9a4fb29fe52680e257de65b1d07e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012404.json",
      "json_path": [
