    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3c72c88a6c5b78f25827ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁与过去一样，一心只想奔跑。\n这让菱亚马逊认为，\n她一定会翻身再起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13f3ef6125534b89ac3c154ba818761d8c467a65696924ad5c615c92780a80b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
